***      COLLECT ta_new.
***
****........Parameter für Stückliste    = 'S'
***      SHIFT ta_out-stlnr LEFT DELETING LEADING '0'.
***      SHIFT ta_out-stlnr RIGHT DELETING TRAILING space.
***      PERFORM w20_material_daten USING ta_out-idnrk
***                                       ta_out-stlnr
***                                       ta_out-stufe
***                                       'S'.
***    ENDIF.
